We should not set the PATH or LD_LIBRARY_PATH when using an SDK.

Without this, sourcing an SDK environment lets ament prepend
$OECORE_TARGET_SYSROOT/opt/ros/$ROS_DISTRO/bin to the host PATH (and the
equivalent to LD_LIBRARY_PATH), pointing host shells at target binaries.

Forward-ported from meta-ros2-kilted's copy (ament-package 0.17.3-1) to
jazzy's ament-package 0.16.5-1; regenerated against SRCREV
2117de89eab1d924d9e6a72ec58f31c221dd49c5 so it applies without offset.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [oe specific]

